881e713b5441ca707b922daf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/28349a64/uploads/origins/93a9bc20-9d98-4702-b57f-76993a3b9804?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa4fc37ca54d027a47ec3460998e1b45 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi!  I'd like to request another illustration of a Maverick from the Rockman X series designed as a female.  For this one, I'd like to request an illustration of Launch Octopus from the first Rockman X as a female.\n\nI'm open to any interpretations on the design or changes as long as the character has more feminine features.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/ts0j0cy63ncs8mcu6pmx1/AItEw4OhIMcqCkFYhiV3GPI?rlkey=htyf4l5aoenqp03h5o77o7emo&st=rjx9vkly&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@FUYUK00RI/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/02269089/uploads/origins/7148dc11-a03e-43f8-9af0-fd91b2f502b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bca31680da570eca4546d8456ec1a8fe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/02269089/uploads/origins/7148dc11-a03e-43f8-9af0-fd91b2f502b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bca31680da570eca4546d8456ec1a8fe, https://si.imgix.net/02269089/uploads/origins/7148dc11-a03e-43f8-9af0-fd91b2f502b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1a509854bfc7f3413f0083d8c1a5e23 2x, https://si.imgix.net/02269089/uploads/origins/7148dc11-a03e-43f8-9af0-fd91b2f502b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67e9d0a261e4368d4d8a9055e0c12e15 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi!  I am looking for an illustration of Spike Rose Red from Mega Man X5.  I'd like to change the character design into a female.\n\nI would like her body shape to be more feminine than the original and her hair to be a long feminine style.  Any other details, changes or interpretations of the character are acceptable!\n\nhttps://www.dropb